 select @notificationcontent=N'Congratulations! In reference to your Job Application and subsequent interviews you had with us, we are delighted to inform that you have been select
ed for Employment in our Organization.Visit the link mentioned below and find the <b>“Offer Letter”</b> and revert with confirm on your acceptance of the same.“Team Mendine” is eagerly waiting to welcome you On-board!'        
